{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1504939-new-changeling-playlist","id":1504939,"title":"New Changeling Playlist","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-03-09T08:17:28-08:00","id":1504939,"title":"New Changeling Playlist","content":"Click <a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLDm3y5gb5VvBAUJ_Gyq41PiIeVZh8Nm0X\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> to hear it. Do tell me if you have other songs to recommend!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-09T08:19:32-08:00","id":1504940,"title":"","content":"<b>FUCKING HELL</b><br /> <br /> DID IT DEADASS ERASE MY HYPERLINK?<br /> <br /> OoOoOoOOoOoOO, NOTHING SCARIER THAN A YOUTUBE VIDEO<br /> <br /> Fine, fuck it. Just search &quot;Changeling The Lost&quot; playlist, it's the one under the &quot;Jabir Eloquentia&quot; channel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-09T08:46:02-08:00","id":1504943,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1504939-new-changeling-playlist?p=1504940#post1504940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>FUCKING HELL</b><br /> <br /> DID IT DEADASS ERASE MY HYPERLINK?<br /> <br /> OoOoOoOOoOoOO, NOTHING SCARIER THAN A YOUTUBE VIDEO</div> </div> </div> </div>TBF, I think that's mostly a function of the new forum's mechanisms to kill ad-bots, which seems to have some unfortunate splash damage. I added a link to a post in an edit, and it forced the post into &quot;we need a mod to look over this now&quot; mode, which was annoying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When the cat's a Stray, the mice will pray...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25851-thestray7","name":"TheStray7","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25851_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-09T10:32:02-08:00","id":1504953,"title":"","content":"On the Playlist itself, there seem to be 4 songs that are now unavailable, which are now hidden. I'm curious as to what they are.<br /> <br /> As for suggestions of my own, given what I've heard so far, I think you might consider:<br /> <br /> &quot;Brain Damage/Eclipse&quot; as covered by Hollo (the original Pink Floyd version is legendary, but you seem to be going for a more metal-heavy list)<br /> <br /> You could almost certainly pull more from the Labyrinth soundtrack. &quot;Within You&quot; is one of my favorites (it's the song that plays during the bit in the Escher room) as is &quot;As The World Falls Down&quot; (from the ballroom scene)<br /> <br /> I saw &quot;Enter Sandman&quot; by Metallica on the list, so I'ma suggest &quot;The Call of Kutlu&quot; and &quot;No Leaf Clover&quot; by them as well.<br /> <br /> Have you heard of The Builders And The Butchers? They have plenty I'd suggest for a Changeling game, but the one I'll recommend for the playlist is &quot;Golden and Green,&quot; which has elements of picking up your life after disaster.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Noose&quot; by A Perfect Circle might fit well (it's about confronting someone who's come out the other side of addiction, but who acts self-righteous about it, acting as if their own past deeds don't matter -- there's plenty of Changelings who act like complete dicks and expect those deeds to be overlooked because of the Hell they themselves went through)<br /> <br /> &quot;Boulevard of Broken Songs&quot; is a mashup of Green Day and Oasis (plus some other bands), and weaves together Boulevard of Broken Dreams and Wonderwall in a way that I don't see a lot of mashups doing. The effect is that the protagonist is walking along while there's another voice trying to offer encouragement that things will get better. It's one of my favorite versions of BoBD ever.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ice Age&quot; by How To Destroy Angels is a slower burn, but a great one about growing alienation (perfect Winter Court music). There's a couple remixes floating about, particularly the Soft Moon remix, thattake the tune in interesting directions.<br /> <br /> I see some music from the Alice Returns soundtrack in the list...I also really enjoy the original Alice game's soundtrack. &quot;Flying on Wings of Steam&quot; and the remix (which is more uptempo) are both really good examples (I think the remix probably fits with the vibe of the playlist better).<br /> <br /> &quot;Shimmy She Wobble&quot; as performed by Otha Turner and The Rising Star Fife and Drum Band was used in &quot;Gangs of new York&quot; as a build up for the opening clash between the Dead Rabbits and The Natives. It's great for any sort of similar build-up, such as The Summer Court going up against a band of Privateers.<br /> <br /> I could go on all day, so I'll let this list stand for now. Let me know if any of my suggestions work for the playlist vibe you're going for!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When the cat's a Stray, the mice will pray...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25851-thestray7","name":"TheStray7","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25851_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-09T12:33:15-08:00","id":1504966,"title":"","content":"&quot;Across the Drift&quot; and &quot;Unstable Molecule&quot; from the Endless Space 2 soundtrack might be good additions too. An interesting selection you've chosen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-11T10:43:29-08:00","id":1505122,"title":"","content":"Please just add whatever catches your fancy from the music of Cosmo Sheldrake<br /> <br /> Also, Oak and Ash and Thorn as sung by the Longest Johns","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-17T15:27:08-07:00","id":1505601,"title":"","content":"I'd go with some of David Bowie early stuff for Changeling the Lost.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}